      "imageWidth": 3200,
      "imageHeight": 4000,
      "story": "Portrait of Fyodor Dostoevsky is an 1872 painting by Vasily Perov, depicting the Russian writer Fyodor Dostoevsky. It was made as part of a portrait series for the Tretyakov Gallery and was well received.",
